		{
			dependencies: ["7D3FA2BBD1033FE9"]
			description: [
				"Solid boilers will generate steam for your first simple machinery. They will output it themselves into connected pipes, so it better to use those that can prevent steam getting into unwanted pipe networks."
				""
				"They need constant inflow of water to not explode. If you still choose to filling it manually then be careful: &oif boiler will heat up to maximum adding water is strictly &lprohibited!&r You need wait for it to cool down.  "
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Steam machinery have exhaust vents that need open space beside them to operate. You can change at which side it gonna be with Wrenches."
				""
				"Unfotunately they can't auto-output or input items by themselves. You need to use additional means like hoppers or other ways. Starting with Low Voltage machinery or some other Redstone Flux machines it not gonna be a problem anymore."
			]
			id: "15C30310B03E4F79"
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 1.0d
